Input: {"question": "What is the profession of C. Mayer?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00", "start": 0, "end": 63, "text": "Christa Mayer Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00", "start": 64, "end": 265, "text": "She is particularly known for her portrayal of Erda in Richard Wagner's \"Ring Cycle\"; a role which she has performed several times at the Bayreuth Festival and recorded on the BBC Legends Record Label."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00", "start": 266, "end": 331, "text": "Christa Mayer was born in Sulzbach-Rosenberg, Germany in Bavaria."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00", "start": 332, "end": 490, "text": "After graduating from the Bavarian Academy of Singing, she pursued further studies at the Munich Academy of Music where she was a pupil of tenor Thomas Moser."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00", "start": 491, "end": 644, "text": "She won several notable singing competitions, including prizes in the ARD International Music Competition in Munich and the International Robert Schumann"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01", "start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01", "start": 58, "end": 175, "text": "She is particularly known for her exceptional skills on the court and has played several times for the national team."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01", "start": 176, "end": 241, "text": "Christa Mayer was born in Sulzbach-Rosenberg, Germany in Bavaria."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01", "start": 242, "end": 413, "text": "After graduating from the Bavarian 