: 134, "end": 227, "text": "Wilson remembered that he was impressed with the boy 's good manners and bright personality ."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03", "start": 228, "end": 358, "text": "[ 22 ] Whenever Mayer visited Saint John in later years , he placed flowers on Wilson 's grave , just as he did on his mother 's ."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03", "start": 359, "end": 394, "text": "[ 22 ] I had been to his hometown ."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03", "start": 395, "end": 425, "text": "I knew from whence he sprang ."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03", "start": 426, "end": 453, "text": "He taught himself grammar ."}, "D4S7": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03", "start": 454, "end": 481, "text": "He taught himself manners ."}, "D4S8": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03", "start": 482, "end": 492, "text": "If anybody"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "German operatic mezzo-soprano", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "professional basketball player", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "French painter", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00:c0", "entity": "C. Mayer", "scope": "profession", "claim": "Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.", "answer": "German operatic mezzo-soprano", "quote": "Christa Mayer Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01:c0", "entity": "C. Mayer", "scope": "profession", "claim": "Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player.", "answer": 